Filter prefixes, one per run.

{{{ =[all[tiddlers]] }}}
{{{ -[tag[done]] }}}
{{{ ~[[fallback]] }}}
{{{ :filter[all[current]] }}}

Negation, suffixes and every operand form.

{{{ [!has[draft.of]] }}}
{{{ [search:title[term]] }}}
{{{ [search:title:casesensitive[term]] }}}
{{{ [get{!!field}] }}}
{{{ [field:name<var>] }}}
{{{ [tag[a]] [tag[b]] }}}

An inline filtered transclusion {{{ [all[current]] ||Template }}} stands mid-sentence.
